        rdfs:label "2011-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth.py L856–L949" ;
        dcterms:description "9 quantitative morphometric measurements with p-values, RMSE, SE, CV, and negative-control deltas" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2011-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth.py#L856-L949> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Savin et al. (2011) Kirchhoff elastic rod + stretched neo-Hookean dorsal mesentery gut looping morphogenesis — Morphometric validation: 93/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L856-949) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty and statistical tests: 4-species wavelength Pearson r = 0.9999 (p = 3.5e-24, RMSE = 0.025 mm), 4-species radius Pearson r = 0.9999 (p = 1.9e-23, RMSE = 0.010 mm), log-log scaling exponent alpha = 0.9963 ± 0.0044 (ref 1.0), Chick E12 relaxed 3D rod wavelength 3.1132 mm (ref 3.12 mm) and radius 1.1499 mm (ref 1.15 mm), surgical ablation tortuosity 1.0000 (ref 1.0), BMP2/Noggin loop-count ratio 1.8581 (ref 2.0909), specimen inter-loop spacing CV = 0.2319, and cross-species lambda/R = 2.7126 (ref 2.7083)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-measurement-4-species-gut-loop-radius-of-curvature-scaling-correlation-savin-et-al-2011-fig-4f>,
